WEBVTT

84fcd030-2164-4af2-a113-e4c7b6baaeb5-0
00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.175
When an incident hits,
Dynatrace alerts the SRE team and takes

84fcd030-2164-4af2-a113-e4c7b6baaeb5-1
00:00:10.175 --> 00:00:11.840
them straight to the problem.

65121253-1501-4017-a830-e1a2cf6d3bf4-0
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.327
Instead of scrambling to figure out what
broke and where,

65121253-1501-4017-a830-e1a2cf6d3bf4-1
00:00:15.327 --> 00:00:18.240
Dynatrace provides a direct link to the
Problems app.

09b8d73c-eab5-4b43-adbe-b18fe17c6fa8-0
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.800
One click and you're in Dynatrace.

5e3ec39a-7c45-4fd6-8fbb-d5be8c507745-0
00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.520
It has already detected the issue and
correlated all telemetry signals.

a46136f2-d4f1-4fdb-9e1d-ce4301505bbc-0
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.625
So the incident overview tells you
exactly what Front End app is affected,

a46136f2-d4f1-4fdb-9e1d-ce4301505bbc-1
00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:33.600
how many services are involved,
and how many users are impacted.

19aaf212-08dc-4dd8-9460-48dbc4af9e57-0
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.920
And it gets better.

6f74ded4-f8fb-47cf-b189-03955aff72d4-0
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.152
Harnessing the power of Dynatrace
intelligence,

6f74ded4-f8fb-47cf-b189-03955aff72d4-1
00:00:39.152 --> 00:00:43.520
Assist explains the incident,
why it happened, and how to remediate it.

8c8f886a-af36-4786-bc36-9ec91d6e3799-0
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.613
The context is enriched through your
preferred CICD tooling,

8c8f886a-af36-4786-bc36-9ec91d6e3799-1
00:00:48.613 --> 00:00:54.460
in this case Argo CD and Assist directs
you to the PR and the exact file that

8c8f886a-af36-4786-bc36-9ec91d6e3799-2
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:55.960
caused the incident.

01160406-ae0c-4e4a-ab9a-4c110a12ff89-0
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.320
No more hunting through your Git history.

57539a66-a313-48cb-b0fd-c0a8a7bb57da-0
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:03.298
When you expand the code,
you can see exactly where things went

57539a66-a313-48cb-b0fd-c0a8a7bb57da-1
00:01:03.298 --> 00:01:03.600
wrong.

3a6f5ca3-b981-435c-9a4a-43010f663743-0
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.897
In this case,
we can see that one of the credit card

3a6f5ca3-b981-435c-9a4a-43010f663743-1
00:01:07.897 --> 00:01:09.680
brands is not being accepted.

897a6d18-b315-434c-a55f-7a0bea72fc7f-0
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:15.875
The culprit was just a variable change,
but in a more complex problem spanning

897a6d18-b315-434c-a55f-7a0bea72fc7f-1
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:19.335
over multiple files,
we could simply revert the PR and then

897a6d18-b315-434c-a55f-7a0bea72fc7f-2
00:01:19.335 --> 00:01:20.720
look for the root cause.

74438207-eb78-42a5-8fb1-03d0496de9aa-0
00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:29.630
Now we're in the Services app
investigating the problem.

3270d2ba-3f45-478a-88cb-dd3fbd887d87-0
00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.623
We will select the Properties tab to
understand which team owns the service

3270d2ba-3f45-478a-88cb-dd3fbd887d87-1
00:01:34.623 --> 00:01:35.430
that has failed.

33df3ddd-5703-4dbb-bd2e-108372b6387f-0
00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.130
As you can see,
we would want to notify someone from Team

33df3ddd-5703-4dbb-bd2e-108372b6387f-1
00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:44.400
Financial Services regarding the failure.

ab09087e-4642-4ff5-b781-b80107886375-0
00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:48.480
No lengthy internal investigation to find
the responsible team.

5eb802f4-50f4-4207-9139-38f65ea2259d-0
00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:52.251
Normally your investigation would end
here,

5eb802f4-50f4-4207-9139-38f65ea2259d-1
00:01:52.251 --> 00:01:56.634
but let's imagine we're in the role of
the owning team conducting A deeper

5eb802f4-50f4-4207-9139-38f65ea2259d-2
00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:57.160
analysis.

6d0a22e2-3953-4575-ba5d-4aa2699aca9e-0
00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.920
Specify the time frame when the error hit.

be41ee55-eee9-40a4-b0df-a513639925fc-0
00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.280
Now you've zeroed in on the key signals.

0392a589-2ccd-47e1-8cce-04b666248342-0
00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.840
Select a particular failure marked in red.

8285de15-d480-4e64-95e0-8c0948962500-0
00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.380
Here we can see where the error occurred
in the trace.

cb1db009-c596-41f5-9da4-ecf017edda48-0
00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:34.967
Select the Exceptions tab to see the
exact line of code where the exception

cb1db009-c596-41f5-9da4-ecf017edda48-1
00:02:34.967 --> 00:02:35.590
was thrown.

07cd2801-6cee-4c56-813b-ffb8bbdcc874-0
00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:46.048
Now for a front end problem,
it's important to know what the user

07cd2801-6cee-4c56-813b-ffb8bbdcc874-1
00:02:46.048 --> 00:02:48.960
actually saw when experiencing this
payment issue.

bf642feb-0c70-4a90-96b1-bf6b02b9802a-0
00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:51.000
From the incident overview.

9ad1d578-c82f-4c73-b0cb-048cb5a38fd8-0
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.320
Let's analyse the error in the Error
Inspector app.

72dabb7b-1947-440e-9cfd-40911321257f-0
00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:01.188
In Error Inspector,
in the context of our problem,

72dabb7b-1947-440e-9cfd-40911321257f-1
00:03:01.188 --> 00:03:07.978
we click Analyse, select the exception,
first party error,

72dabb7b-1947-440e-9cfd-40911321257f-2
00:03:07.978 --> 00:03:17.184
click on the session ID to understand
what the user saw when this payment issue

72dabb7b-1947-440e-9cfd-40911321257f-3
00:03:17.184 --> 00:03:18.220
occurred.

1d68631f-cd9b-4746-8627-f7304577d90d-0
00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.600
Scrub through the clip to see every click
and every screen prior to failure.

e09aa938-059e-481d-bc79-ef49a76709ac-0
00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.160
The red markings in the timeline will
tell you exactly when the error occurred.

3956a30a-2af6-4c20-9057-4136ee664637-0
00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.368
In this case,
the UI did not provide the user any

3956a30a-2af6-4c20-9057-4136ee664637-1
00:03:34.368 --> 00:03:35.280
visual feedback.

ff2010e5-4ccc-4e6a-bbf4-6afb4d452070-0
00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.320
This completes our investigation.

8308cd20-b74a-4fd5-ba00-871f5e9fcc83-0
00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.440
The error was traced from the back end to
the front end.

80c79749-b8c5-4891-bd52-3aba26926dff-0
00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:45.960
The responsible team was informed and the
root cause was determined.

